'''Bang-Bang''' (だっふんと機関銃 ''Daffun to Kikan Jū'', "'''[[wikipedia:Sailor Suit and Machine Gun (film)|Dagshund and Machine Gun]]'''") is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy introduced in [[FINALS WEEK#Go Go Graduates!|Go Go Graduates!]]. She was added in [[Version 6.9 Update|Version 6.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Bang-Bang
|image = E 390.png
|appearance = [[FINALS WEEK#Go Go Graduates!|Go Go Graduates!]]<br>[[Citadel#Traitless|Traitless Citadel]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
A [[Dagshund]] with a sailor suit and machine gun. She has a longer backswing and attack rate making her even easier to stall, but she makes up for that with the ability to slow cats from afar.

